{{!-- the header, the same on every page: the brand (`label` its name for assistive tech), then the pages as the game's
tab bar (an uma's Details tabs) in the same order, the page you are on (`current`) the green tab, and light / dark as
the game's two-way switch (the green knob on the mode in use, both icons shown; theme.hbs keeps it current). On a phone
the brand and the switch share the first row, the tabs the full width under them.
The wordmark is drawn as the game draws a title, the rounded face at its heaviest: "uma" as the favicon's three sparkles
are (each letter its sparkle's pale fill, strong outline and softer halo: stat blue, aptitude pink, unique green),
"-legacy" in the game's brown outlined in white. u, m and a are spaced: each is its own span, so without it one letter's
outline paints over the last one's fill (within "-legacy", one run, the outlines sit under every fill). The other tabs'
brown on white keeps /about's AAA; the green tab is the game's white outlined text. --}}
{{#*inline "tab"}}inline-flex min-h-9 items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap px-4.5 pt-0.75 pb-1.5 font-game font-bold leading-tight focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:-outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-gm-green2 not-on:text-gm-ink not-on:not-first:inset-shadow-divide not-on:hover:bg-gm-tab-low on:art-bright on:text-white on:text-shadow-outline on:inset-shadow-seg-on max-md:min-h-11 max-md:px-1{{/inline}}
<header class="mx-auto mb-4.5 flex max-w-page flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-4.5 gap-y-1.5 max-md:grid max-md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] max-md:items-center max-md:gap-2.5">
  <h1 class="inline-flex items-center gap-[0.3em] text-balance text-brand font-black [&>svg]:size-[1.25em] [&>svg]:flex-none" aria-label="{{label}}">{{{logo}}}<span class="font-game font-black tracking-normal text-gm-ink letter-edge-brand drop-shadow-brand" aria-hidden="true"><span class="tracking-wider text-brand-u letter-edge-u shade-brand-u">u</span><span class="tracking-wider text-brand-m letter-edge-m shade-brand-m">m</span><span class="tracking-wider text-brand-a letter-edge-a shade-brand-a">a</span>-legacy</span></h1>
  <nav class="ml-auto inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 self-center max-md:contents" aria-label="Pages"><div class="inline-grid auto-cols-fr grid-flow-col overflow-hidden rounded-full border border-gm-tab-edge bg-gm-tab inset-shadow-well shadow-tab max-md:col-span-full max-md:row-2 max-md:grid"><a href="./" class="{{> tab}}"{{#if (eq current "career")}} aria-current="page"{{/if}}>Career planner</a><a href="loop" class="{{> tab}}"{{#if (eq current "loop")}} aria-current="page"{{/if}}>Loop planner</a><a href="about" class="{{> tab}}"{{#if (eq current "about")}} aria-current="page"{{/if}}>How this works</a></div> <button type="button" class="relative inline-grid h-8.5 w-18 grid-cols-2 items-center rounded-full border border-gm-tab-edge bg-gm-tab px-0.75 pt-0.75 pb-1.25 text-gm-ink2 inset-shadow-well before:absolute before:top-0.75 before:bottom-1.25 before:left-0.75 before:w-[calc(50%-3px)] before:rounded-full before:art-bright before:inset-shadow-knob before:transition-transform focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-gm-green2 motion-reduce:before:transition-none dark:before:translate-x-full max-md:col-2 max-md:row-1 max-md:h-11 max-md:w-19.5" id="theme-btn" data-motion aria-label="Dark mode" aria-pressed="false" title="Switch to dark mode"><svg class="relative order-1 size-4.25 justify-self-center dark:text-white dark:shade-outline" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 14.5A8 8 0 1 1 9.5 4a6.5 6.5 0 0 0 10.5 10.5z" fill="currentColor"/></svg><svg class="relative size-4.25 justify-self-center not-dark:text-white not-dark:shade-outline" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4.5" fill="currentColor"/><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 2v2.5M12 19.5V22M2 12h2.5M19.5 12H22M4.9 4.9l1.8 1.8M17.3 17.3l1.8 1.8M4.9 19.1l1.8-1.8M17.3 6.7l1.8-1.8"/></g></svg></button></nav>
</header>
